            <title>[LU-20298] build fixes for gcc16 / fedora 44 </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20298</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In function ‘format_param’,&lt;br/&gt;
  ‘strncat’ specified bound depends on the length of the source &lt;br/&gt;
NOTE: suffix_len is always 1 or 0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;In function ‘format_param’,
    inlined from ‘do_param_op’ at lustre_param.c:843:16:
lustre_param.c:171:25: error: ‘strncat’ specified bound depends on the length of the source argument [-Werror=stringop-overflow=]
  171 |                         strncat(param_name, suffix,
      |                         ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  172 |                                 strlen(param_name) + suffix_len);
      |                                 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
lustre_param.c:166:30: note: length computed here
  166 |                 suffix_len = strlen(suffix);
      |                              ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~
At top level:
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In function ‘mntdf’:&lt;br/&gt;
  int total_field_count = 0; is set but not used.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs.c: In function ‘mntdf’:
lfs.c:8954:13: error: variable ‘total_field_count’ set but not used [-Werror=unused-but-set-variable=]
 8954 |         int total_field_count = 0;
      |             ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
At top level:
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In function 'lustre_lnet_show_net':&lt;br/&gt;
  net_num is set but no used.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;liblnetconfig.c: In function 'lustre_lnet_show_net':
liblnetconfig.c:3160:13: error: variable 'net_num' set but not used [-Werror=unused-but-set-variable=]
 3160 |         int net_num = 0;
      |             ^~~~~~~
At top level:
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
